column2:
TWICE WORLD TOUR 2026 - THIS IS FOR (1st Leg)

I’ve been listening to TWICE since their debut in 2015, and I’ve always dreamed of working with them. Fortunately, 11 years after their debut, I finally had the opportunity to operate the camera for their This Is For World Tour. It was a blessing and a truly meaningful experience to finally be part of their crew, especially knowing that it could be one of their last tours together.

@twicetagram #Thisisfor #Once #Concert #Tour #Cameraoperator

